# List of Programs in this directory
All programs are from Kernighan and Ritchie's C Programming book

## Chapter 1
revtemp - Exercise 1-5 - create the temperature conversion program to print the table in reverse order

getcharverify - Exercise 1-6 - verify that the expression `getchar() != EOF` is 0 or 1

printeofchar - Exercise 1-7 - print out the expression `EOF` character value

counthidden - Exercise 1-8 - Write a program to count blanks, tabs, and newlines

removeblanks - Exercise 1-9 - Write a program to copy its input to its output, replacing each string with one or more blanks by a single blank

visiblehidden - Exercise 1-10 - write a program to copy it's input to its output, replacing each tab with `\t`, each backspace with `\b`, and each backslash by `\\`, making tabs and backspaces visible in an unambiguous way.


